                <pb facs="0642" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.2123/22: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-21T13:00:00-05:00">February 21, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 23—2:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>95. Leticia.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>My telegram No. 92, February 20, 11 a.m., paragraph 2. Save for slight
                        trouble with some manifestants shouting too insistently for general amnesty
                        for political prisoners, political demonstration passed without unfortunate
                        event. <hi rendition="#italic">Comercio</hi> estimates 100,000 participants,
                        which is possibly an exaggeration. People seemingly took occasion as a
                        holiday. Enthusiasm shown due chiefly to fostering by the Government and <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Comercio’s</hi> campaign and can be regarded as
                        spontaneous only to a moderate degree. Nevertheless Government for the
                        moment has a certain moral advantage and mandate making its task
                        easier.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Proper precautions having been taken in time no molestation of Colombians
                        or this Embassy as custodian Colombian interests took place and with
                        departure of Lozano situation is easier.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
